OL,3,GNEWSATemporary skips in bid to cut
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkips are to be placed in five
OL,7,Flocations across North East
OL,8,FLincolnshire as the council aims to
OL,9,Freduce fly-tipping.
OL,11,FThe Skip It scheme, launched in 2018,
OL,12,Fgives residents a chance to dispose of
OL,13,Funwanted items including garden
OL,14,Fclippings, small electrical items,
OL,15,Frecycling and mattresses free of
OL,16,Fcharge.
OL,18,FSkips will be placed at five temporary
OL,19,Fsites in the coming months - with the
OL,20,Ffirst at Duke of York Gardens,
OL,21,FCorporation Road, Grimsby on Tuesday 6
OL,22,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
