OL,3,GNEWSATemporary skips in bid to cut
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Darren Mayne, North East
OL,7,FLincolnshire Council's portfolio holder
OL,8,Ffor waste, recycling and energy, said:
OL,9,F"It gives everyone a chance to dispose
OL,10,Fof their unwanted rubbish without it
OL,11,Fending up as fly-tipping."
